    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing doesn't really do anything. it's not like i can just breathe away how much everything hurts. it feels like there's no way to actually get away from it. like no matter where i go or what i do, the noise is just... always there. i'm just so tired of trying to fight it.",
